.
.  Generate sample output for Double Exponetial PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na dexpdf.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Double Exponential PDF
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT DEXPDF(X) FOR X = -5 0.01 5
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp DEXPDF.PS dexpdf.ps
system rm DEXPDF.PS
.
quit
